      "id": 1,
      "title": "Experimental cross-node workload mTLS \u2014 security gate remains open",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Two nodes \u00b7 no application sidecars \u00b7 node-level ztunnel\n**Positive path:** client on `cmtc-mtls-worker` \u2192 server on `cmtc-mtls-control-plane`, via Service and Pod IP.\n\n**FAILED SECURITY GATE:** an unenrolled client reached port 80 over plaintext ([issue #8](https://github.com/ephico2real2/clustermesh-trust-controller/issues/8)). This view demonstrates the encrypted positive path, not complete fail-closed protection or cross-cluster readiness."
      }
    },
    {
