      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Identity:** `spiffe://cmtc-mtls.test/ns/mtls-spike/sa/client` \u2192 `\u2026/sa/server`. The applications have one container each; ztunnel is deployed per node.\n\n**Independent local checks:** public SVID chains and URI SANs verified; enrolled capture contained TLS application records and no HTTP canary. Control capture exposed the canary. Prior bounded load: **1,200/1,200 HTTP 200 via Service + 1,200/1,200 via Pod IP**.\n\nPanels above query native ztunnel TCP counters under fresh load. TCP opens are not HTTP requests or TLS handshakes. This isolated single-cluster spike does not qualify ClusterMesh or WireGuard/IPsec composition."
      }
